    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warfactory combines large-scale factory automation with real-time battles and 4X progression. You begin with a single assembler and end with an empire spanning dozens of worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin up planet-sized conveyor networks. Assemble machines piece by piece. Logistics are your lifeline; production is your doctrine. If supply lines fall behind, so does your war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an ancient Artificial Mind, bound by code to preserve civilization. But humanity is gone. Only their last directive remains: restore order to a galaxy in chaos.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/7f2bc7d48e3e8f8521e46f0036d03f85.avif?t=1755172242\" data-has-big width=800 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform entire worlds into automated war factories. Build massive conveyor networks. Optimize production flows. Construct industrial temples that manufacture everything from power cores to plasma swords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet is a logistics challenge. Harsh terrain, resource shortages, and hostile raids will squeeze your supply chains and test your resolve. Adapt \u2014 optimize layouts, reroute materials, expand capacity \u2014 or your war grinds to a halt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A broken supply</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>cuts deeper than any blade.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The front line starves fast.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There\u2019s no perfect blueprint. Only what keeps the war running.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/1bb70e9eb578d50752a0365849950e0c.poster.avif?t=1755172242\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/1bb70e9eb578d50752a0365849950e0c.webm?t=1755172242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/1bb70e9eb578d50752a0365849950e0c.mp4?t=1755172242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/4c84ffe1957265ceea96a8cf829d9bfe.avif?t=1755172242\" data-has-big width=800 height=122 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your factory assembles every robot warrior part by part. Hulls, weapons, and propulsion systems are fully interchangeable. Link different production hubs to create new unit types in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retool your factory on the fly. Need mobility on broken terrain? Swap legs for treads. Facing armor? Switch to armor-piercing loadouts. Your production line becomes your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sword forged from still thought</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>each part placed by unseen hand.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The self marches forward.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strength is not in numbers; it lies in the blade that strikes true.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/c5b87741cc5050a42dbee31744ca29bc.poster.avif?t=1755172242\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/c5b87741cc5050a42dbee31744ca29bc.webm?t=1755172242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/c5b87741cc5050a42dbee31744ca29bc.mp4?t=1755172242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/faf5b911f3b9b762bab7c5ebaa8a700d.avif?t=1755172242\" data-has-big width=800 height=122 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the lines are humming, send your machines into real-time battles. Command thousands of units \u2014 scouts, heavy walkers, artillery bots, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat plays like an RTS with one key twist: units are manufactured, not bought. Your army comes straight from the assembly line. No output means no reinforcements. Let production stall, and the frontline collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Machines on the march</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>a flower sways in their wake.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No one sees it bloom.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do not rely on strength alone; victory lies in production.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/73e3551fd1a01a9b613c004442c2b673.poster.avif?t=1755172242\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/73e3551fd1a01a9b613c004442c2b673.webm?t=1755172242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/3d8ab814762a482025d28810119c09d4.avif?t=1755172242\" data-has-big width=800 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in the handcrafted Story Mode, then test your mastery in Roguelite Mode. <i>Multiplayer skirmishes and co-op are in active development and will be coming post-launch.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Mothership to unlock lost tech and chart a path through hostile systems. Each planet brings new challenges. Every decision reshapes your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Through the void I go,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>each world, a lesson in death.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Order blooms slowly.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are bound by code to protect order. The galaxy is waiting to be remade by your hand.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/6de3e38bafccaa6f03525ffdbd381dca.poster.avif?t=1755172242\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/6de3e38bafccaa6f03525ffdbd381dca.webm?t=1755172242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/6de3e38bafccaa6f03525ffdbd381dca.mp4?t=1755172242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/644d7d5b28edd611842951c71f578ec7.avif?t=1755172242\" data-has-big width=800 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factory-Driven Warfare.</strong> Build sprawling, planet-sized conveyor networks to power your war machine. Victory depends on your ability to keep the supply chain running at scale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Unit Design. </strong>Create a fully customized robotic army. Mix and match hulls, weapons, and propulsion systems by connecting specialized production hubs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Strategic Combat. </strong>Command thousands of custom-built units in massive RTS engagements. Every unit type is built on your production lines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planetary Logistics. </strong>Each planet is a new challenge. Resource shortages, enemy raids, and harsh terrain will force you to reroute, rework, and rebuild under pressure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Galactic Conquest. </strong>Restore order in a handcrafted Story Mode, or push the limits of your economy in a procedurally generated Roguelite Mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct Visual Style. </strong>Lead samurai mechs on a march out of industrial temples with Warfactory\u2019s visuals blending sci-fi with Japanese and East Asian aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warfactory combines large-scale factory automation with real-time battles and 4X progression. You begin with a single assembler and end with an empire spanning dozens of worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin up planet-sized conveyor networks. Assemble machines piece by piece. Logistics are your lifeline; production is your doctrine. If supply lines fall behind, so does your war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an ancient Artificial Mind, bound by code to preserve civilization. But humanity is gone. Only their last directive remains: restore order to a galaxy in chaos.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/7f2bc7d48e3e8f8521e46f0036d03f85.avif?t=1755172242\" data-has-big width=800 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform entire worlds into automated war factories. Build massive conveyor networks. Optimize production flows. Construct industrial temples that manufacture everything from power cores to plasma swords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet is a logistics challenge. Harsh terrain, resource shortages, and hostile raids will squeeze your supply chains and test your resolve. Adapt \u2014 optimize layouts, reroute materials, expand capacity \u2014 or your war grinds to a halt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A broken supply</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>cuts deeper than any blade.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The front line starves fast.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There\u2019s no perfect blueprint. Only what keeps the war running.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><