t=1755172242\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/c5b87741cc5050a42dbee31744ca29bc.webm?t=1755172242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/c5b87741cc5050a42dbee31744ca29bc.mp4?t=1755172242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/faf5b911f3b9b762bab7c5ebaa8a700d.avif?t=1755172242\" data-has-big width=800 height=122 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the lines are humming, send your machines into real-time battles. Command thousands of units \u2014 scouts, heavy walkers, artillery bots, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat plays like an RTS with one key twist: units are manufactured, not bought. Your army comes straight from the assembly line. No output means no reinforcements. Let production stall, and the frontline collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Machines on the march</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>a flower sways in their wake.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No one sees it bloom.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do not rely on strength alone; victory lies in production.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/73e3551fd1a01a9b613c004442c2b673.poster.avif?t=1755172242\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/73e3551fd1a01a9b613c004442c2b673.webm?t=1755172242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/3d8ab814762a482025d28810119c09d4.avif?t=1755172242\" data-has-big width=800 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in the handcrafted Story Mode, then test your mastery in Roguelite Mode. <i>Multiplayer skirmishes and co-op are in active development and will be coming post-launch.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Mothership to unlock lost tech and chart a path through hostile systems. Each planet brings new challenges. Every decision reshapes your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Through the void I go,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>each world, a lesson in death.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Order blooms slowly.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are bound by code to protect order. The galaxy is waiting to be remade by your hand.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/6de3e38bafccaa6f03525ffdbd381dca.poster.avif?t=1755172242\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/6de3e38bafccaa6f03525ffdbd381dca.webm?t=1755172242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/6de3e38bafccaa6f03525ffdbd381dca.mp4?t=1755172242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396160/extras/644d7d5b28edd611842951c71f578ec7.avif?t=1755172242\" data-has-big width=800 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factory-Driven Warfare.</strong> Build sprawling, planet-sized conveyor networks to power your war machine. Victory depends on your ability to keep the supply chain running at scale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Unit Design. </strong>Create a fully customized robotic army. Mix and match hulls, weapons, and propulsion systems by connecting specialized production hubs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Strategic Combat. </strong>Command thousands of custom-built units in massive RTS engagements. Every unit type is built on your production lines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planetary Logistics. </strong>Each planet is a new challenge. Resource shortages, enemy raids, and harsh terrain will force you to reroute, rework, and rebuild under pressure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Galactic Conquest. </strong>Restore order in a handcrafted Story Mode, or push the limits of your economy in a procedurally generated Roguelite Mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct Visual Style. </strong>Lead samurai mechs on a march out of industrial temples with Warfactory\u2019s visuals blending sci-fi with Japanese and East Asian aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
